c chi ph\'dd th\'f9c t\'d5 \'ae\'ad\'eec ph\'d0p thanh to\'b8n, c\'e9ng (+) th\'aam m\'e9t kho\'b6n \'ae\'ad\'eec t\'ddnh b\'bbng t\'fb l\'d6 ph\'c7n tr\'a8m (%) tr\'aan nh\'f7ng chi ph\'dd n\'b5y ho\'c6c \'ae\'ad\'eec t\'ddnh th\'aam m\'e9t kho\'b6n ph
