\'dd tri\'d3n khai \'ae\'b7 \'ae\'ad\'eec v\'e8n h\'e3a l\'b5 TSC\'a7 v\'ab h\'d7nh;
\par }{\f15\fs16 
\par }{\f15\fs26 (b) Ti\'d2n thu t\'f5 vi\'d6c thanh l\'fd, nh\'ad\'eeng b\'b8n TSC\'a7 v\'b5 c\'b8c t\'b5i s\'b6n d\'b5i h\'b9n kh\'b8c;
\par }{\f15\fs16 
\par }{\f15\fs26 (c) Ti\'d2n chi cho vay \'ae\'e8i v\'edi b\'aan kh\'b8c, tr\'f5 ti\'d2n chi cho vay c\'f1a ng\'a9n h\'b5ng, t\'e6 ch\'f8c t\'ddn d\'f4ng v\'b5 c\'b8c t\'e6 ch\'f8c t\'b5i ch\'ddnh; ti\'d2n chi mua c\'b8c c\'abng c\'f4 n\'ee c\'f1a c\'b8c \'ae
